    "title": "Born After the Storm: New Orleans teens launch podcast on Katrina's legacy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "New Orleans\nBorn After the Storm: New Orleans teens launch podcast on Katrina’s legacy\n55 minutes ago\nNEW ORLEANS — Two decades after Hurricane Katrina, a new generation of New Orleanians is telling the story of the storm — in their own words. “Born After the Storm” is a new youth-produced podcast created at Be Loud Studios. The series features 15 local high school students who weren’t alive when Katrina struck, but who say the storm still shapes their lives, families, and communities.",
